# --- Vendor clone: never committed here ---
# drunix/ is a separate clone of https://github.com/npci/drunix (Fabric fork
# + drunix-network test-network). It carries its own git history, and every
# time network/net.sh brings the network up it generates real, live private
# keys and MSP/TLS material under drunix-network/test-network/{crypto-config,
# organizations,channel-artifacts}/ — those must never leave this machine.
# See README.md "Getting drunix/" for how a teammate gets their own copy.
/drunix/

# --- Go build artifacts ---
# `go mod vendor` runs automatically as part of every chaincode deploy
# (network.sh's packageCC.sh) and drops a full copy of every dependency's
# source under vendor/ — regenerated on demand, never hand-maintained.
vendor/
*.test

# --- Local env / secrets (none exist yet; future-proofing for gateway/web) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Chaincode packaging scratch (produced by test-network scripts if run
# from inside our own tree; normally these land in drunix/, not here, but
# ignore them here too in case a packaging command is ever run from here) ---
*.tar.gz
log.txt

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
